sequenceDiagram
    autonumber

    actor Keeper as Warehouse Keeper
    actor Admin as Administrator

    participant UI as Web Portal / Warehouse App
    participant ImageAPI as Image Upload API (design)
    participant Blob as Azure Blob Storage
    participant API as WriteOffController (design)
    participant Service as WriteOffService (design)
    participant Store as WriteOffStore (design)
    participant DB as PostgreSQL Database

    %% ==========================================
    %% 1. CREATE WRITE-OFF REQUEST
    %% ==========================================

    Keeper->>+UI: Create Write-Off Request

    Note over Keeper,UI: Select batches, quantities, reason,<br/>disposal method and evidence image

    %% ==========================================
    %% 2. UPLOAD EVIDENCE
    %% ==========================================

    UI->>+ImageAPI: UploadEvidence(image)

    ImageAPI->>+Blob: Store evidence image
    Blob-->>ImageAPI: Image reference or upload error
    deactivate Blob

    ImageAPI-->>UI: Evidence upload result
    deactivate ImageAPI

    alt Evidence uploaded successfully

        %% ==========================================
        %% 3. SUBMIT WRITE-OFF REQUEST
        %% ==========================================

        UI->>+API: Create(writeOffData, evidenceRef)
        API->>+Service: CreateAsync(writeOffData)

        Service->>+Store: Validate request and warehouse access

        Store->>+DB: SELECT warehouse, batches, balances and reservations
        DB-->>Store: Current inventory and access information
        deactivate DB

        Store-->>Service: Validation data
        deactivate Store

        alt Duplicate request already exists

            Service-->>API: Return existing WriteOff

        else Valid request without reservation conflict

            Note right of Service: Validate quantity, disposal method,<br/>reason and evidence reference

            Service->>+Store: Save WriteOff, items and attachments

            Store->>+DB: INSERT WriteOff, WriteOffItems and attachments
            Note right of DB: Status = Pending Admin Approval<br/>No inventory quantity is changed

            DB-->>Store: Write-Off request created
            deactivate DB

            Store-->>Service: Pending WriteOff
            deactivate Store

            Service-->>API: WriteOffResult

        else Invalid request or reserved stock conflict

            Service-->>API: Validation or conflict error

        end

        deactivate Service

        API-->>UI: Creation result
        deactivate API

    else Evidence upload failed

        Note over UI,Blob: Do not submit a Write-Off request without valid evidence

    end

    UI-->>Keeper: Display submission result
    deactivate UI

    %% ==========================================
    %% 4. ADMINISTRATOR REVIEWS WRITE-OFF
    %% ==========================================

    Admin->>+UI: Open pending Write-Off

    UI->>+API: Get(writeOffId)
    API->>+Service: GetAsync(writeOffId)

    Service->>+Store: FindAsync(writeOffId)

    Store->>+DB: SELECT WriteOff, items and evidence references
    DB-->>Store: Write-Off details
    deactivate DB

    Store-->>Service: Write-Off information
    deactivate Store

    Service-->>API: WriteOffResult
    deactivate Service

    API-->>UI: Write-Off details
    deactivate API

    UI-->>Admin: Display batches, quantities and evidence
    deactivate UI

    %% ==========================================
    %% 5. ADMINISTRATOR MAKES DECISION
    %% ==========================================

    Admin->>+UI: Approve or Reject Write-Off

    alt Administrator approves

        UI->>+API: Approve(writeOffId, version)
        API->>+Service: ApproveAsync(writeOffId, version)

        %% ==========================================
        %% 6. REVALIDATE INVENTORY
        %% ==========================================

        Service->>+Store: ApproveAndPostAsync(writeOffId, version)

        Store->>+DB: BEGIN TRANSACTION and SELECT affected rows FOR UPDATE
        DB-->>Store: Locked WriteOff, balances and reservation data
        deactivate DB

        Note over Store,DB: Recheck approval status, stock quantity,<br/>active reservations and inventory locks

        alt Write-Off already approved

            Store->>+DB: COMMIT without additional stock movement
            DB-->>Store: Existing result preserved
            deactivate DB

            Store-->>Service: Already approved

        else Eligible for write-off

            %% ==========================================
            %% 7. COMMIT INVENTORY WRITE-OFF
            %% ==========================================

            Note over Store,DB: Quantity must not exceed unreserved stock

            Store->>+DB: UPDATE physical stock and matching inventory locks
            Note right of DB: Close affected locks and invalidate<br/>related QR labels

            DB-->>Store: Inventory updates applied
            deactivate DB

            Store->>+DB: INSERT inventory movements and audit records
            Note right of DB: Mark WriteOff as Approved

            DB-->>Store: Write-Off records persisted
            deactivate DB

            Store->>+DB: COMMIT TRANSACTION
            DB-->>Store: Write-Off committed
            deactivate DB

            Store-->>Service: Approval successful

        else Invalid status, stale version or reserved stock conflict

            Store->>+DB: ROLLBACK TRANSACTION
            DB-->>Store: No stock changes committed
            deactivate DB

            Store-->>Service: Approval rejected with reason

        end

        deactivate Store

        Service-->>API: Approval result
        deactivate Service

        API-->>UI: Approval response
        deactivate API

    else Administrator rejects

        %% ==========================================
        %% 8. REJECT WRITE-OFF REQUEST
        %% ==========================================

        UI->>+API: Reject(writeOffId, reason)
        API->>+Service: RejectAsync(writeOffId, reason)

        Note right of Service: Rejection requires a reason<br/>and a pending request

        Service->>+Store: RejectPendingAsync(writeOffId, reason)

        Store->>+DB: UPDATE WriteOff status and INSERT audit record
        Note right of DB: Do not modify physical stock<br/>or active reservations

        DB-->>Store: Rejected or validation conflict
        deactivate DB

        Store-->>Service: Rejection result
        deactivate Store

        Service-->>API: Rejection result
        deactivate Service

        API-->>UI: Rejection response
        deactivate API

    end

    UI-->>Admin: Display final Write-Off status
    deactivate UI

    Note over Service,DB: An approved Write-Off decreases physical stock exactly once